DirectorySlash Off
RewriteEngine On

RewriteRule ^(uploads|documents|images|file)$ $1/ [L]

Options +Indexes
IndexOptions FancyIndexing VersionSort NameWidth=* DescriptionWidth=*
IndexOrderDefault Descending Date

AddDescription "Image file" .jpg .jpeg
AddDescription "Image file" .png .gif .webp
AddDescription "Document" .pdf
AddDescription "Data export" .csv
AddDescription "Archive" .zip
